{"t_ms": 16500375, "conversation_id": "conv_immediate_s4_020", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["In-room Safe Instructions\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nEvery room is equipped with an electronic safety locker for storing valuables such as passports, cash, jewelry, and electronic devices. Guests are advised to set a personal PIN while using the safe. The hotel is not responsible for valuables left unsecured outside the in-room safe. For additional assistance, guests may contact the Front Desk.", "Housekeeping Schedule\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nDaily housekeeping services are provided between 9:00 AM and 5:00 PM. Guests who prefer not to be disturbed may activate the \"Do Not Disturb\" indicator outside their room. Additional cleaning requests or replenishment of towels and toiletries can be made by contacting housekeeping through the in-room telephone.", "Lost & Found Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nItems found within the hotel premises are recorded and securely stored by the housekeeping department. Guests who believe they have misplaced personal belongings should contact the Front Desk with a detailed description of the item. Unclaimed items are generally retained for 90 days before being disposed of in accordance with hotel policy."], "scores": [0.6674616932868958, 0.8022764921188354, 0.8317709565162659], "filenames": ["20_room_safe.txt", "15_housekeeping.txt", "09_lost_and_found.txt"], "timing_policy": "immediate", "timing_trigger": "immediate", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 78, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
